@{
    Layout = "_SiteLayout";
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy";
}
<section class="site-wrap section">
    <div style="max-width:720px">
        <div class="eyebrow">Privacy</div>
        <h1 style="font-size:clamp(34px,4vw,50px);margin-bottom:20px">A demonstration platform.</h1>
        <div class="card"><div class="card-body stack-md">
            <p>Keyhaven is a demonstration property management application built with ASP.NET Core MVC. All names, properties, tenancies, certificates and email messages are fictional and seeded for the demo.</p>
            <p>No data entered here is sent to a third party, and the application stores its data in a local SQLite database. The demo is not intended to hold real personal or client data.</p>
            <p>If you are evaluating the platform and would like to discuss a production deployment, please get in touch at <a class="accent-text" href="mailto:hello@keyhaven.example">hello@keyhaven.example</a>.</p>
        </div></div>
    </div>
</section>
